      "title": "Block Density — Topic Coherence and Table Extraction Skill",
      "description": "Audits individual content blocks for single-topic coherence, length, and embedded tables.  Blocks that cover multiple topics or exceed ~2/3 of a page should be split; large tables (>5 rows) must be their own `table` block.  Child blocks from a split may belong in different chapters than the parent.",
